<title>FRANCE: MATIF says options quoting returns to normal.</title>
<headline>MATIF says options quoting returns to normal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matif SA said quotations on its notionnel bond options had returned to normal after an earlier fault which had made the live data suspect.</p>
</text>
